a struktur ini cocok","value":"mengapa-struktur-ini-cocok","line":27,"column":0,"depth":2},"buka-ringkasan-per-part":{"type":"header","text":"Buka ringkasan per part","value":"buka-ringkasan-per-part","line":37,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai.part-i","book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai.part-ii","book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai.part-iii","book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai.part-iv","book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai.part-v"],"parent":"book-summaries","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"the-developers-guide-to-ai\">The Developer's Guide to AI<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#the-developers-guide-to-ai\"></a></h1>\n<p>Ini file root untuk <code>The Developer's Guide to AI</code>. Isi di sini hanya preface/intro, lalu langsung diarahkan ke ringkasan per part. Detail chapter dan pembahasan teknis ada di file terpisah.</p>\n<p>Buku ini disusun sebagai peta kerja developer yang bergerak dari model dasar ke sistem agent lengkap:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Part I: Getting Started with AI</li>\n<li>Part II: Prompt Engineering</li>\n<li>Part III: Vector Databases and RAG</li>\n<li>Part IV: Adapting Models to Real-World Tasks</li>\n<li>Part V: Building Agentic Systems</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Root ini berarti fokusnya pada konteks, target pembaca, dan alur besar buku.</p>\n<h2 id=\"mengapa-struktur-ini-cocok\">Mengapa struktur ini cocok<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#mengapa-struktur-ini-cocok\"></a></h2>\n<p>Buku ini tidak berusaha jadi referensi teori ML. Dia lebih membentuk peta praktis bagi developer yang pengin:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>pakai LLM tanpa harus jadi peneliti ML</li>\n<li>kontrol output lewat prompt dan kode</li>\n<li>tambahkan konteks dari data eksternal</li>\n<li>adaptasi model saat use case butuh</li>\n<li>bangun agent sebagai sistem yang bisa bertindak</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"buka-ringkasan-per-part\">Buka ringkasan per part<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#buka-ringkasan-per-part\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai.part-i\">The Developer’s Guide to AI — Part I: Getting Started with AI</a> — Getting Started with AI</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai.part-ii\">The Developer’s Guide to AI — Part II: Prompt Engineering</a> — Prompt Engineering</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai.part-iii\">The Developer’s Guide to AI — Part III: Vector Databases and RAG</a> — Vector Databases and RAG</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai.part-iv\">The Developer’s Guide to AI — Part IV: Adapting Models to Real-World Tasks</a> — Adapting Models to Real-World Tasks</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai.part-v\">The Developer’s Guide to AI — Part V: Building Agentic Systems</a> — Building Agentic Systems</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<strong>Children</strong>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai.part-i\">The Developer’s Guide to AI — Part I: Getting Started with AI</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai.part-ii\">The Developer’s Guide to AI — Part II: Prompt Engineering</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai.part-iii\">The Developer’s Guide to AI — Part III: Vector Databases and RAG</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai.part-iv\">The Developer’s Guide to AI — Part IV: Adapting Models to Real-World Tasks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai.part-v\">The Developer’s Guide to AI — Part V: Building Agentic Systems</a></li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">ai (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">guide (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">developer (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272449631\">Otomasi menggeser nilai kerja dari eksekusi manual ke desain dan adaptasi sistem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272449632\">API dan SDK membuat AI jadi komponen software, bukan domain riset terpisah</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272449633\">AI jadi berguna ketika model digabung dengan database dan retrieval</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272449634\">Buku ini mengunci perspektif developer-first untuk AI integration, bukan research-first model building</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272449635\">Developer AI sebaiknya fokus pada composition, bukan membangun foundational model sendiri</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272449636\">AI recipes pentingnya lebih besar daripada model tunggal</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272449637\">Developer perlu mental model produk lebih dari model AI</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272449638\">Traction tanpa leverage operasional bisa berubah jadi krisis</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272449639\">Pekerjaan repetitif adalah kandidat AI alami</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272449640\">API call adalah pintu masuk developer ke AI</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272449641\">LLM membutuhkan grounding untuk bisa berguna</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272449642\">LLM kuat bahasa tapi lemah truth domain privat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272449643\">LLM adalah model pretrained, bukan sihir</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272449644\">Output LLM dibangun lewat next-token prediction</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272449645\">Inference dan training adalah dua tahap berbeda</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272449646\">LLM probabilistik; kode tradisional deterministik</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272449647\">Hallucination adalah konsekuensi arsitektural LLM</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272449648\">Prompt engineering adalah intervensi pertama termurah</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272449649\">Context engineering melebihi sekadar wording prompt</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272449650\">Aplikasi AI pertama adalah plumbing request-model-response</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272449651\">Local model membantu belajar integrasi tanpa vendor noise</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272449652\">Streaming token dapat diubah jadi UX responsif</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272449653\">ReadableStream membuat browser ikut memproses respons LLM secara progresif</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272449654\">Python dipilih AI karena ekosistem, bukan syntax</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272449655\">Ulangi contoh di bahasa lain untuk isolasi konsep</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272449656\">Typed boundaries penting dalam layanan AI</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272449657\">Generator Python cocok untuk streaming response LLM</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272812605\">Prompt engineering lahir ketika “kasih semua context” mulai gagal</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272812606\">Data ada tetapi harus disusun sebagai konteks berguna</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272812607\">Prompt besar tanpa struktur mentok di limit dan kebingungan</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272812608\">Prompt engineering adalah mekanisme steering, bukan mantra</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272812609\">LLM tidak mengerti maksud; LLM hanya tahu teks yang dikirim</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272812610\">Prompt yang vague memaksa model menebak</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272812611\">Prompt terbaik dibangun dari komponen fungsional</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272812612\">Context window adalah constraint resource, bukan sekadar konteks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272812613\">Token adalah unit biaya dan kapasitas</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272812614\">Lebih banyak konteks tidak otomatis lebih baik</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272812615\">Instruction prompting adalah baseline dasar</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272812616\">Persona adalah compression mechanism untuk framing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272812617\">In-context examples mengajari pola tanpa mengubah weights</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272812618\">Delimiters adalah information architecture untuk prompt</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272812619\">Chain-of-thought memberi struktur reasoning intermediate</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272812620\">Prompt chaining memecah masalah kompleks jadi workflow prompt</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272812621\">Prompt harus diperlakukan seperti code</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272812622\">Prompt bagus di playground belum tentu cukup di produksi</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272812623\">Abstraction library adalah keputusan arsitektural</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272812624\">Output configuration adalah bagian dari control surface</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272812625\">Prompt template memisahkan logic dari prompt assembly</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272812626\">System messages dan roles membuat prompt jadi protocol</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272812627\">Chat memory adalah ilusi aplikasi, bukan kemampuan model</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272812628\">History bertarung dengan token budget</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272812629\">Summarization mengompres history tanpa kehilangan konteks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777281650097\">Frekuensi tinggi membuat support AI jadi masalah operasional utama</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777281760000\">Opportunity cost support adalah alasan utama untuk AI dalam tim produk</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777282133922\">AI adoption kadang lahir dari constraint ekonomi, bukan teknologi keren</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777282388177\">Reframing operasional support ke sistematisasi itu kunci, bukan langsung training model</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777282527277\">AI support agent sering diposisikan sebagai garis pertahanan pertama, bukan pengganti manusia</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777349193467\">Nilai model dibatasi oleh distribusi data latihnya</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777362905431\">Grounding adalah menyuplai konteks yang hilang saat inference tanpa mengubah model</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260423114258\">Profil author membantu membaca buku AI dengan ekspektasi yang tepat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260423114450\">Introduction buku AI harus jadi manifesto peralihan mindset</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260423115403\">Startup story di awal Part I berfungsi sebagai problem generator AI</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260423124353\">LLM penting sebagai pelurus intuisi engineering</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260423125630\">AI app paling efektif dilihat sebagai service dependency</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260424003951\">Part II Prompt Engineering adalah layer kontrol di atas model</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260424010000\">Prompt engineering adalah lapisan kontrol pertama untuk LLM</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.literature.the-developers-guide-to-ai\">The Developer's Guide to AI sebagai literature note</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.moc.the-developers-guide-to-ai\">MOC The Developer's Guide to AI</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersion":"0.83.0","vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"journal":{"dailyDomain":"daily","name":"journal","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd","addBehavior":"childOfDomain"},"scratch":{"name":"scratch","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd.HHmmss","addBehavior":"asOwnDomain"},"task":{"name":"","dateFormat":"","addBehavior":"childOfCurrent","statusSymbols":{"":" ","wip":"w","done":"x","assigned":"a","moved":"m","blocked":"b","delegated":"l","dropped":"d","pending":"y"},"prioritySymbols":{"H":"high","M":"medium","L":"low"},"todoIntegration":false,"createTaskSelectionType":"selection2link","taskCompleteStatus":["done","x"]},"graph":{"zoomSpeed":1,"createStub":false},"enableAutoCreateOnDefinition":false,"enableXVaultWikiLink":false,"enableRemoteVaultInit":true,"enableUserTags":true,"enableHashTags":true,"workspaceVaultSyncMode":"noCommit","enableAutoFoldFrontmatter":false,"enableEditorDecorations":true,"maxPreviewsCached":10,"maxNoteLength":204800,"seeds":{"dendron.templates":{}},"enableFullHierarchyNoteTitle":false},"preview":{"enableFMTitle":true,"enableNoteTitleForLink":true,"enableFrontm